                <BinaryString name="Tags"></BinaryString>
                <string name="Text">&lt;b&gt;Adaptation: &lt;font color="#9966ff"&gt;Foresight&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After being hit by the same move three times (not necessarily in a row), you &lt;b&gt;adapt&lt;/b&gt; to that specific attack. Once adapted, you gain a 25% chance to dodge that attack whenever it is used against you. Living Blade remembers all adapted attacks for its entire lifespan, allowing you to continue dodging them until death resets the effect.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;b&gt;Debuff:&lt;/b&gt; Each successful dodge reduces your defense by 7% for 10 seconds. (Not stackable).
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note:&lt;/b&gt; Progress toward adaptation has a 10-second cooldown. A distinct sound effect and purple vignette will indicate when progress is made. Some moves cannot be adapted to.&lt;/p&gt; Your dodge has a 3 second cooldown, although this is rarely noticeable.


&lt;b&gt;Adaptation: &lt;font color="#ff0000"&gt;Bloodlust&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After every kill, you gain a 2% damage boost. This bonus can stack up to 5 times, for a maximum of 10% increased damage. In addition, each kill grants a temporary buff to &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color="#9966ff"&gt;Foresight&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, increasing its dodge chance from 25% to 55% for 30 seconds. (Not stackable). A purple aura will appear to indicate this buff.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;b&gt;Debuff:&lt;/b&gt; With each kill, your defense is reduced by 1.5%. This penalty stacks up to 5 times, reaching a maximum of 7.5% reduced defense.


&lt;b&gt;Pose:&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While posing, a series of quick-time events will appear on your screen. Each successful input restores a small amount of health. Using your pose outside of combat further increases the amount healed.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
                <Color3 name="TextColor3">
                  <R>1</R>
                  <G>1</G>
                  <B>1</B>
                </Color3>
