                <string name="Text"><![CDATA[<b><font color="#ff0000">Atonement</font></b>
<p>Atonement has two possible outcomes, depending on whether the Victim survives or fails the Minigame.</p>

<b>Victim Survives:</b> If the Victim successfully endures the Minigame, they seize the knife from the user's hands and strike back, stabbing the user in return.

<b>Victim Fails:</b> If the Victim fails to evade the incoming attacks, the user executes a brutal finisher, killing them instantly.

<p><b>Note:</b> Using this move on a weakened target increases their chances of losing the Minigame, as it will take fewer hits to kill them.</p>
]]></string>
